      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i guess. it just feels like a loop. like i'm running a race that has no finish line and everyone else is just watching me struggle. i look at people living their lives so easily and i just... i dont see a point to it anymore. it just feels like a lot of pain for no real reason.",
